[{"title":"杂咏","author":"李畅","text":"太极始混沌，两仪正鸿濛。\n阴阳既无象，运化焉有穷。\n元始授我气，大块铸我躬。\n究观万物理，廓然等虚空。\n止水知色相，灵明悟厥宗。\n人胡滑其外，我独守其中。\n阅历几千变，同归一榻风。\n俯仰劳形役，徒尔日憧憧。\n冲然守真素，庶与道性融。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32169,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐美人为梁希湛作","author":"李畅","text":"美人酌我金屈卮，灯前漫笑鸣朱丝。\n湘水烟花渺无极，巫山暮雨恨何时。\n一曲未终情哽咽，再行一鼓心断绝。\n莺簧百转绿杨深，雁柱千行青竹裂。\n须臾四座笑颜开，霓裳起舞香风回。\n清歌正遏流云驻，大嚼不觉玉山颓。\n昨日春风到芳草，今朝春色满怀抱。\n袖拂梨花片片轻，杯分桃叶纤纤好。\n劝君莫惜醉流连，劝君莫却红锦缠。\n歌残酒尽共归去，亭亭璧月明中天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32170,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴歌 其一","author":"李畅","text":"杨柳悲兮波练练，萸菊芳兮霜片片。\n暑往急宾鸿，秋来归社燕。\n驱人形役困红尘，眼底光阴奔赤电。\n人生得丧恒有时，天道循环沧海变。\n机心世态任如钩，鄙性吾生本如箭。\n君不见九衢遢邋何贤豪，倾夺经营互矜艳。\n相逢浩饮但高歌，莫问荣华与衰贱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32171,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴歌 其二","author":"李畅","text":"秋波澹澹澄如练，古木寒枝霜霰片。\n长坂嗟驽骀，卑栖嘲雀燕。\n蛰龙大泽困泥滓，会得春风起雷电。\n吾生蹭蹬道路中，敢拟飞腾望迁变。\n俯仰空怜头上冠，机栝何能弦上箭。\n君不见买臣半世恒负薪，一朝遇合争奇艳。\n人生七尺何昂藏，尘埃且莫轻贫贱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮吟","author":"李畅","text":"罗浮山高高接天，飞梁挂壁相钩连。\n四百之峰如蜿蜒，上有玉鹅珠瀑拂青烟。\n金沙紫洞连云穿，东望赤日扶桑颠。\n金球夜半跃虞渊，又如奔龙撼流泉。\n水帘喷雾清且涟，琼窗绀阁倚云边。\n朱陵会真挹诸仙，交梨碧藕开琼筵。\n云軿鹤驭来飘翩，疑是真人葛稚川。\n黄龙扫石三千年，丹灶云沉事不传。\n我来为结青山缘，此中不用买山钱。\n石床流水抚残弦，秋阴落叶响鸣蝉。\n大笑引满霞觞前，青泥坐对日流涎。\n丹台姓字亦徒然，狂歌一曲逍遥篇。\n醉来岸帻抱云眠，欲向蓬丘问偓佺。\n清风一枕梅花梦，蝴蝶峰头月正圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠华道人","author":"李畅","text":"翩翩一羽容，高枕足烟霞。\n沆瀣山中酒，菖蒲石上花。\n苔痕侵座遍，峰影隔帘斜。\n倘遇赤松子，相从驻岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和杨肖韩比部春日环翠轩 其一","author":"李畅","text":"景物春仍媚，芳菲处处同。\n柳风吹絮白，杏雨落花红。\n帘卷西山下，樽开北海中。\n更堪留暮醉，初月满晴空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和杨肖韩比部春日环翠轩 其二","author":"李畅","text":"何人开竹院，有客洗梨妆。\n傍柳通幽径，寻溪度石梁。\n落花春已半，啼鸟日初长。\n徙倚东风外，高情讵可量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明后三日偕陈尧伯冼衍孔卢少虚南浦泛舟遇雨","author":"李畅","text":"春流南浦绿，泛棹晚风前。\n对酒争传曲，狂歌独扣舷。\n山云来骤雨，岸火起新烟。\n何处兰桡女，褰裳湿采莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲江道中","author":"李畅","text":"江水溶溶碧，峰峦万万重。\n藤萝悬鸟雀，波浪隐鱼龙。\n树色笼朝霭，人烟乱夕峰。\n清光好迟我，今夜客芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将赴金陵庞弼唐郡伯高苕峰司马贻赠孤鹤横秋卷赋谢","author":"李畅","text":"萧萧逐马尘，客路酒相亲。\n鸿鹄非无志，鹪鹩笑此身。\n帆迎珠海暮，柳绽白门春。\n为语社中子，新诗忆寄频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庐山","author":"李畅","text":"见说匡君宅，芙蓉万仞山。\n霞光遥可掇，竹影杳难攀。\n插碧千峰秀，流丹九曲环。\n相将横羽翮，来往水云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答钓叟","author":"李畅","text":"十年长作客，此夕思无穷。\n飘泊云山外，萧条旅食中。\n江寒芦带雪，日落荇牵风。\n愧尔烟波叟，长歌捲钓筒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭蠡舟中姚南建林慕樵刘元山三孝廉夜话得昏字","author":"李畅","text":"泛泛宫亭上，停桡日正昏。\n江天同一色，烟月细重论。\n渔火湖边艇，人家竹里村。\n春来云水阔，阳鸟任孤鶱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊游","author":"李畅","text":"雨过草萋萋，荒郊兴共携。\n斗鸡宜落日，戏马自长堤。\n舞榭香风簇，歌台紫雾迷。\n百钱行自乐，一醉任如泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠林侯远参军北上奏最","author":"李畅","text":"万里游燕客，三春度粤行。\n君才方展骥，帝宠是迁莺。\n秋水芙蓉艳，金沙鸂鷘明。\n一枝烦驿使，知是慰同盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端溪访古上人","author":"李畅","text":"步入招提境，浑疑是化城。\n雨花飘梵色，落叶度秋声。\n石涧千丝细，云门一派清。\n竹炉煎活水，相对话无生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出泷","author":"李畅","text":"水落滩声咽，舟移夕照寒。\n鱼龙潜泽国，鸿雁度江干。\n双鬓乾坤老，三秋道路难。\n浮云烟水晚，何处是平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答刘使君","author":"李畅","text":"落日迷春树，天涯忆去年。\n揶揄空自诧，衰病有谁怜。\n旧业堪招隐，新诗解入禅。\n知君未得意，共结小山缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32187,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春意","author":"李畅","text":"郊原春欲动，骀荡遍岩阿。\n紫燕双飞入，黄莺百啭过。\n柳风吹几席，杏雨濯江河。\n寄傲南窗下，陶情一啸歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32188,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮邱","author":"李畅","text":"此地堪招隐，因之纪胜游。\n瑶坛耀风日，琪树几春秋。\n绿羽仙人盖，朱明太史楼。\n偶来扫云石，杯酒任夷犹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32189,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浈江","author":"李畅","text":"薄暮浈江上，微风趁夕帆。\n沙鸥轻泛泛，英石自岩岩。\n海阔月先到，山高日半衔。\n临流无一事，相对浣征衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32190,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣力南归寄陈宗典布邦直梁体立梁任伯诸丈","author":"李畅","text":"力耕曾共岭云东，一别音尘渺去鸿。\n赋就北山愁自结，梦回南浦忆谁同。\n故园怅望关河外，薄宦行藏涕泪中。\n此夕怀人迥无寐，萧萧凉雨滴疏桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32191,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日钟山人见过","author":"李畅","text":"閒引庭阴扫落花，春风词客到贫家。\n官衙一径惟栽竹，宦况三年正及瓜。\n玩世未应悬组绶，逃名端合卧烟霞。\n烦君为结东皋隐，自笑归来鬓已华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32192,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送薛侯宣博士上春官","author":"李畅","text":"岳立儒林鬓未皤，横经谁不羡西河。\n两龚学就师承远，大戴书传子弟多。\n价比南金初入洛，名同片玉晚登科。\n金明池上花如簇，好向春风策马过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32193,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"匡庐晚望","author":"李畅","text":"指点匡山动客情，寒烟初散暮云横。\n峰头古寺千林静，湖上春帆一叶轻。\n瀑布尚流经腊雪，梅花犹吐隔年英。\n佛灯隐隐钟声渺，风送鄱阳一夜行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32194,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简庞弼唐郡伯","author":"李畅","text":"先生夙抱太玄心，石上鸣泉是素琴。\n鳣席数年催鹿角，鸿篇万里售鸡林。\n遗经世擅玄成业，大雅兼闻正始音。\n坐里春风多岁月，出门流水落花深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32195,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"家大人手构二亭间树松竹颜曰晚翠曰知津暇日经过长吟野望令人有濠濮间想因成一律","author":"李畅","text":"曲曲江流绕钓矶，江亭云物转霏微。\n春深蒲柳疑烟湿，日落帆樯带雨归。\n绿酒漫堪成独啸，白鸥应识久忘机。\n津头竟日无人问，为向春风一振衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32196,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕子矶","author":"李畅","text":"燕子矶头巀嵲开，当矶渤浪隐春雷。\n龙盘地拥三山动，虎踞江连万里来。\n上下水天涵日月，参差云树隐楼台。\n扬帆未得穷登眺，独倚蓬窗漫举杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32197,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春怨","author":"李畅","text":"闻道郊原绿正肥，小窗帘捲思依依。\n莺啼树底惊残梦，鹊噪檐前送夕晖。\n芳草雨馀三月暮，海棠花落一春违。\n柔肠百结真堪断，薄倖江南归未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32198,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"李畅","text":"何处黄鹂破暝烟，苏公堤上柳初眠。\n百千斗酒倾朱阁，十二霓裳舞玳筵。\n倚槛云霞天外寺，采莲歌吹画中船。\n风流不数江州客，卧对湖光好住年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32199,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳后五日同黄筠溪明府登山作","author":"李畅","text":"皂帽青鞋不惮劳，玄蝉哕哕遍亭皋。\n秋光莫讶黄花晚，岚气初浮白雁高。\n日落长林皆竹色，风回寒涧起松涛。\n多君雅有龙山兴，潦倒宁辞醉浊醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32200,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁幼宁博士会试","author":"李畅","text":"粤海秋深载酒过，劳劳亭畔引长歌。\n词坛彩笔看龙跃，帝里黄金买骏多。\n太史五云传日色，故人三径滞烟萝。\n遥看月落灯毬夜，花底莺声叶佩珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32201,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜","author":"李畅","text":"云拥海门雨气，风迎野寺钟声。\n二月江山媚景，三春花鸟多情。\n寒浦鱼灯远近，长江雁语凄清。\n贳得邻酤自笑，与谁共话平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32202,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云溪","author":"李畅","text":"丹溜鸣泉花院，青山绕郭松阴。\n水边鱼鸟清影，竹下笙簧好音。\n烟锁霜林鹤唳，风生岚壑龙吟。\n晚来溪上独眺，四野寒云重侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32203,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓江","author":"李畅","text":"细雨溪边箬笠，寒江把钓自给。\n鲈肥留供一醉，酒幔秀风吹入。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32204,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江楼秋感","author":"李畅","text":"万籁无声月一钩，白云飞尽水悠悠。\n凭栏厌听清商曲，目断天南树树秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32205,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门","author":"李畅","text":"积石中流事已虚，东封丸土亦何如。\n秋深木落空江色，犹向楼船忆故墟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32206,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江曲","author":"李畅","text":"夜泛天高露湿衣，扁舟空载月明归。\n凄清何处一声笛，惊起前汀宿雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32207,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阙题","author":"朱沾","text":"犀锁猿环事已空，独馀楼阁倚千峰。\n南连蓬岛诸天近，北接曹溪一脉通。\n好把酒杯消俗虑，休将幻化问前踪。\n山灵勿厌频来我，我即邻溪老遁翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32208,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏新辟邑城","author":"黎新","text":"王事驰驱羡独贤，屡逢盘错不辞坚。\n齐中城迹樊侯再，许下田功都尉先。\n闾里共瞻新邑宰，簪裾原是旧家传。\n异时人比河阳县，只说栽桃自记年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32209,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟憩采石饮谪仙楼","author":"周一士","text":"朝乘采石槎，暮招采石月。\n月堕谪仙楼，光景两殊绝。\n谪仙之人去何之，月明不减谪仙时。\n便呼明月与我饮，深杯到手且莫辞。\n累累马鬣摧芳草，坐对青山人已老。\n扑面红尘拂地来，万事何如一杯好。\n金波潋滟流滔滔，曾照当年宫锦袍。\n此时扶醉见天子，珠玉错落随挥毫。\n太真力士自贵倨，醉眼俯视如蛴螬。\n由来圣达遭贝锦，太白自是人中豪。\n夜郎长流何不可，千驷九鼎真鸿毛。\n古人今人只如此，斗酒百篇吾与尔。\n酣歌击楫任波涛，一醉万缘皆已矣。\n莫问骑鲸事有无，弄月嘲风人未死。\n诗卷长留天地间，漠漠云山共流水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32210,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆母","author":"周一士","text":"身在青山里，心悬白发前。\n饥来驱我去，老合抱孙眠。\n习懒诗成癖，除愁酒亦仙。\n定知贫有骨，差取世人怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32211,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中渡韩泷","author":"周一士","text":"韩泷临绝巘，眺望俯层台。\n玉柱从天下，银河倒地回。\n飞流奔万马，触石动轰雷。\n坐见安澜者，那知济险才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32212,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归至宜章寄卫勉斋","author":"周一士","text":"颇忆来时路，风尘隔岁华。\n梨花千万树，茅屋两三家。\n古堞喧归鸟，疏烟带晚霞。\n美人修竹里，怅望海天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32213,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陆载之","author":"周一士","text":"短发论文日，头颅今若何。\n贫非缘酒债，瘦岂为诗魔。\n野梦徒蕉鹿，时情任雀罗。\n谁能游五岳，婚嫁累人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32214,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日书怀寄谭山人永明","author":"周一士","text":"长夏迢迢叹索居，侧身天地一蘧庐。\n浮云白日悲歌里，秣马中原感慨馀。\n未信文章雄海峤，肯将勋业问樵渔。\n贾生才调应殊绝，千载犹闻痛哭书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32215,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋徐海翁招同邓虚舟集饮山亭","author":"周一士","text":"百尺孤亭鸟道斜，欲随芳草问瑶华。\n平临玉宇三千界，俯瞰尘寰十万家。\n风挟涛声来偃盖，云连海色带蒹葭。\n班荆细酌谈锋剧，散落峰头片片霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32216,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽尹冲元明府 其一","author":"周一士","text":"追欢梓里几连翩，岁厄龙蛇倍怆然。\n阅世乍云还乍雨，思君如砥复如弦。\n兰桡冷落荷花片，月榭虚悬竹树颠。\n悟得此身如幻泡，始知遗蜕是生天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32217,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽尹冲元明府 其二","author":"周一士","text":"解组归来日枕流，摊书林下雪盈头。\n难将媚骨随尘世，祇有童心任拍浮。\n史窃累累张左马，诗篇籍籍亚曹刘。\n翛然一觉游仙梦，月旦凭谁续太邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32218,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝云墓","author":"周一士","text":"一随仙客度梅关，逝水东流竟不还。\n鳄渚烟深愁翠黛，丰湖草绿暗朱颜。\n魂销蜀道三千里，肠断阳台十二山。\n惟有峰头双白鹤，几回清梦到人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32219,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙岩夜月","author":"张元僎","text":"夜启仙扃秋入户，带将银兔穿廊庑。\n山明忽讶涧云生，川白犹疑芦花吐。\n光透竹枝凤如栖，媚生松径鹤来舞。\n几时载酒一登临，荡涤空中愁万古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32220,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圆珠积翠","author":"侯应达","text":"西北多灵蕴，圆珠独献奇。\n青葱满地绣，错落一天机。\n明月光犹动，春风色更姿。\n□□□二美，时可应昌期。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32221,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹤洲渔唱","author":"侯应达","text":"波恬鹤洲上，渔舟泛泛横。\n歌来同日和，风送隔江听。\n漠漠春湖绿，潇潇秋岸明。\n临渊笑过客，徒有羡鱼情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32222,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌石醴泉","author":"侯应达","text":"一窍先天水，混然出石门。\n□□□瀣露，散作辘轳春。\n瓮低宁忧□，□□不厌贫。\n我□犹可漉，不负旧时巾。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32223,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓山吊古","author":"黄孚","text":"谁向沧波问钓徒，荒陵故垒日模糊。\n可怜杵臼能存赵，漫道嫖姚解灭胡。\n独忍间关正气在，却输筹策赤心孤。\n无常天命空挥涕，忍使龙宫收帝图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32224,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贞节石桥","author":"黄孚","text":"榕叶阴阴覆小溪，行人桥上晚潮低。\n阿婆天与陂头上，岁岁清明鞠马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32225,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别邓升仲三首 其一","author":"黎邦琛","text":"岂有长途隔，离居亦黯然。\n襟期两年尽，得失寸心怜。\n别簪萦愁恋，芳华托梦悬。\n不知南浦月，相送几时圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32226,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别邓升仲三首 其二","author":"黎邦琛","text":"相依难作别，况复值烦忧。\n蔓草萦新恨，飞花感昔游。\n容华悲水逝，生计逐萍浮。\n叹惜繁华尽，春风唤独愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32227,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别邓升仲三首 其三","author":"黎邦琛","text":"与子周旋久，幽栖借一枝。\n才名人共妒，贫贱尔偏知。\n鸡黍终言晤，莺花自岁时。\n谁怜风月夜，相忆各分歧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32228,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代牛郎问","author":"黎邦琛","text":"迢迢牛女宿，闻道昨宵分。\n河落馀星佩，桥空散鹊群。\n金梭停夜月，玉箸湿重云。\n得似离人恨，因风遥问君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32229,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代牛女答","author":"黎邦琛","text":"闻君今夜恩，少别已如斯。\n何况一年隔，兼之千里思。\n髻鬟随月堕，环佩拂云垂。\n欲向人间问，乘槎知几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32230,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邓升仲作四首 其一","author":"黎邦琛","text":"危楼曾共倚阑干，杨柳春风分外寒。\n今日登临虚怅望，青山争似去年看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32231,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邓升仲作四首 其二","author":"黎邦琛","text":"五载寒灯对掩扉，烟花风月几曾离。\n那堪动隔经旬别，泪尽南窗苦竹枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":32232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]